ENDEDIT

# a box over four fresh corners, caught in CROSSING order. Angle order makes the square; the selection's own order would cross itself. The earlier box join landed on a set already joined, so the duplicate check answered before ordering was consulted, and ordering went untested -- one step exercising two checks proves neither, as with the bowties and D-022
