SEL clear
ENDEDIT

# the lines drawn on the map: only between two nodes, each link ONCE, heavy when its sender is selected and light when only its receiver is, side by side when two nodes feed each other. A line's share counts silence: a node's lines, plus its own output (no line), plus its silence, add up to 100%
EDIT link_lines ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
