# a hundred channels: too narrow for any label of its own, so the row is marked like a ruler, every fifth channel. Under the old bar-by-bar rule nothing at all was written; with thirty, some bars kept a name, others a number, others nothing -- the patchwork reported in use
EDIT chart_labels_ruler ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
DO auto
EXPECT 0 0 "auto-output off: new nodes start unbound"
STATE N  | R  | O  | L  | D  | C - | S - | A 0
DO newoutput
