DO redo
EXPECT 1 0 "redid use rig"
STATE N n0@0.5,0.8 n1@0.2,0.2 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:0.501187 n2:2:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 | D sum3:3:>n0,>n1 | C n1 | S n0,n1 | A 1
ENDEDIT

# a rig that lacks an output of this map is refused, naming it, and nothing changes; so is a rig file that is not there
EDIT rig_refused ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
DO place 0.2 0.2
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 | R  | O n0:0:1 | L n0>n0:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO place 0.8 0.2
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 n1@0.8,0.2 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO saverig pair
EXPECT 0 0 "saved rig pair-rig.json"
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 n1@0.8,0.2 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO place 0.5 0.8
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 n1@0.8,0.2 n2@0.5,0.8 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 n2:2:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 n2>n2:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO userig pair
EXPECT 0 1 "cannot use rig pair -- not in it, or not the same kind: n2"
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 n1@0.8,0.2 n2@0.5,0.8 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 n2:2:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 n2>n2:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO userig nowhere
EXPECT 0 1 "cannot open nowhere-rig.json"
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 n1@0.8,0.2 n2@0.5,0.8 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 n2:2:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 n2>n2:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO undo
EXPECT 1 0 "undid place"
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 n1@0.8,0.2 | R  | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 | L n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
ENDEDIT

# the rig computes sum2 from outputs; this map fills sum2 from its nodes. Same name, same channel, different meaning: refused rather than quietly replaced
EDIT rig_kind_mismatch ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
DO place 0.2 0.2
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N n0@0.2,0.2 | R  | O n0:0:1 | L n0>n0:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1
DO place 0.8 0.2
EXPECT 1 0 ""
