ENDEDIT

#--------------------------------------------------------------------
# ROUND 3A-6: LEVELS IN THE EDITOR
#
# The model holds a 3D map and a current level. Output keys act
# on every level; binding keys on the current one. Every state
# past the first level also lists each level: its starting
# height, its bent nodes, its bindings (Z0, Z1, ...).
#--------------------------------------------------------------------
# the example map: n copies the level above, halfway to the next or a quarter beyond the top; N below. The new level becomes current. Up and down move between levels and stop at the ends; they are not undo steps, new levels are
EDIT levels_new_and_switch ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
DO example
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1
DO levelup
EXPECT 0 0 "one level -- n makes another"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1
