DO newlevel 1
EXPECT 1 0 "new level 2 of 2, at 0.25, with 9 outputs of its own"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 O-2:5:1 N-2:6:1 E-2:7:1 S-2:8:1 W-2:9:1 A-2:10:1 B-2:11:1 C-2:12:1 D-2:13:1 | L O>O-2:4 N>N-2:1 E>E-2:1 S>S-2:1 W>W-2:1 A>A-2:1 B>B-2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2:2 D>D-2:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1 | V 1 | Z0 0 K O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z1 0.25 K O>O-2:4 N>N-2:1 E>E-2:1 S>S-2:1 W>W-2:1 A>A-2:1 B>B-2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2:2 D>D-2:1 D>~:0.333333
