#--------------------------------------------------------------------
# ROUND 3A-6d: EACH LEVEL PUTS OUT ITS OWN NUMBERS
#
# With auto-output on, a new level's nodes each get an output of
# their own -- N-2, E-2 -- on the next free channels; what each
# sent to outputs goes to that one, its silence stays. What the
# outputs drive is up to what they are connected to.
#--------------------------------------------------------------------
# a new level's own outputs: named after the node and the level it was made as, kept unique with _2; fills and silence carry over; with auto-output off the level shares the outputs it was copied from. Removing a level takes the outputs only it used
EDIT levels_own_outputs ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
DO example
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1
DO newlevel 1
EXPECT 1 0 "new level 2 of 2, at 0.25, with 9 outputs of its own"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 O-2:5:1 N-2:6:1 E-2:7:1 S-2:8:1 W-2:9:1 A-2:10:1 B-2:11:1 C-2:12:1 D-2:13:1 | L O>O-2:4 N>N-2:1 E>E-2:1 S>S-2:1 W>W-2:1 A>A-2:1 B>B-2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2:2 D>D-2:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1 | V 1 | Z0 0 K O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z1 0.25 K O>O-2:4 N>N-2:1 E>E-2:1 S>S-2:1 W>W-2:1 A>A-2:1 B>B-2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2:2 D>D-2:1 D>~:0.333333
DO leveldown
EXPECT 0 0 "level 1 of 2, at 0"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 O-2:5:1 N-2:6:1 E-2:7:1 S-2:8:1 W-2:9:1 A-2:10:1 B-2:11:1 C-2:12:1 D-2:13:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1 | V 0 | Z0 0 K O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z1 0.25 K O>O-2:4 N>N-2:1 E>E-2:1 S>S-2:1 W>W-2:1 A>A-2:1 B>B-2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2:2 D>D-2:1 D>~:0.333333
# n from the ground with level 2 there: halfway, and the new
# level is level 2 now -- its names are taken, so _2
DO newlevel 1
EXPECT 1 0 "new level 2 of 3, at 0.125, with 9 outputs of its own"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 O-2:5:1 N-2:6:1 E-2:7:1 S-2:8:1 W-2:9:1 A-2:10:1 B-2:11:1 C-2:12:1 D-2:13:1 O-2_2:14:1 N-2_2:15:1 E-2_2:16:1 S-2_2:17:1 W-2_2:18:1 A-2_2:19:1 B-2_2:20:1 C-2_2:21:1 D-2_2:22:1 | L O>O-2_2:4 N>N-2_2:1 E>E-2_2:1 S>S-2_2:1 W>W-2_2:1 A>A-2_2:1 B>B-2_2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2_2:2 D>D-2_2:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1 | V 1 | Z0 0 K O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z1 0.125 K O>O-2_2:4 N>N-2_2:1 E>E-2_2:1 S>S-2_2:1 W>W-2_2:1 A>A-2_2:1 B>B-2_2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2_2:2 D>D-2_2:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z2 0.25 K O>O-2:4 N>N-2:1 E>E-2:1 S>S-2:1 W>W-2:1 A>A-2:1 B>B-2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2:2 D>D-2:1 D>~:0.333333
DO auto
EXPECT 0 0 "auto-output off: new nodes start unbound"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 O-2:5:1 N-2:6:1 E-2:7:1 S-2:8:1 W-2:9:1 A-2:10:1 B-2:11:1 C-2:12:1 D-2:13:1 O-2_2:14:1 N-2_2:15:1 E-2_2:16:1 S-2_2:17:1 W-2_2:18:1 A-2_2:19:1 B-2_2:20:1 C-2_2:21:1 D-2_2:22:1 | L O>O-2_2:4 N>N-2_2:1 E>E-2_2:1 S>S-2_2:1 W>W-2_2:1 A>A-2_2:1 B>B-2_2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2_2:2 D>D-2_2:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 0 | V 1 | Z0 0 K O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z1 0.125 K O>O-2_2:4 N>N-2_2:1 E>E-2_2:1 S>S-2_2:1 W>W-2_2:1 A>A-2_2:1 B>B-2_2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2_2:2 D>D-2_2:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z2 0.25 K O>O-2:4 N>N-2:1 E>E-2:1 S>S-2:1 W>W-2:1 A>A-2:1 B>B-2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2:2 D>D-2:1 D>~:0.333333
DO newlevel 1
EXPECT 1 0 "new level 3 of 4, at 0.1875"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 O-2:5:1 N-2:6:1 E-2:7:1 S-2:8:1 W-2:9:1 A-2:10:1 B-2:11:1 C-2:12:1 D-2:13:1 O-2_2:14:1 N-2_2:15:1 E-2_2:16:1 S-2_2:17:1 W-2_2:18:1 A-2_2:19:1 B-2_2:20:1 C-2_2:21:1 D-2_2:22:1 | L O>O-2_2:4 N>N-2_2:1 E>E-2_2:1 S>S-2_2:1 W>W-2_2:1 A>A-2_2:1 B>B-2_2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2_2:2 D>D-2_2:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 0 | V 2 | Z0 0 K O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z1 0.125 K O>O-2_2:4 N>N-2_2:1 E>E-2_2:1 S>S-2_2:1 W>W-2_2:1 A>A-2_2:1 B>B-2_2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2_2:2 D>D-2_2:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z2 0.1875 K O>O-2_2:4 N>N-2_2:1 E>E-2_2:1 S>S-2_2:1 W>W-2_2:1 A>A-2_2:1 B>B-2_2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2_2:2 D>D-2_2:1 D>~:0.333333 | Z3 0.25 K O>O-2:4 N>N-2:1 E>E-2:1 S>S-2:1 W>W-2:1 A>A-2:1 B>B-2:1 B>~:1 C>C-2:2 D>D-2:1 D>~:0.333333
DO removelevel
EXPECT 1 0 "removed level 3; now on level 2 of 3"
