SEL clear
ENDEDIT

#--------------------------------------------------------------------
# ROUND 3A-7: NODE VALUES
#
# A named number each node carries on each level; what it means
# is up to what reads it. U lists the values (name:lo:hi:fallback),
# X<k> each level's numbers that differ from the fallback.
#--------------------------------------------------------------------
# g makes a value from a typed line -- a name, or a name and its range; z renames or re-ranges the current one, bringing every number inside; j cycles; G removes. Refused: no name, a name taken, a range that is not two numbers low then high
EDIT values_made_and_named ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
DO example
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1
KEYS drag=0 aud=0 grid=lattice EXPECT place:1 box:1 toggle:1 all:1 none:0 move:1 freehand:0 join:0 unjoin:0 remove:0 gridkind:1 rotate:1 spacing:1 spokes:0 deadzone:1 layoutsize:1 layout:1 newoutput:1 pickoutput:1 addoutput:1 nextoutput:1 bind:0 bindall:0 fill:0 clear:0 silence:0 derivedafter:1 derived:0 trim:1 removeoutput:1 autooutput:1 levelswitch:0 newlevel:1 raise:0 movelevel:0 match:0 removelevel:0 view3d:1 newvalue:1 pickvalue:0 stepvalue:0 editvalue:0 removevalue:0 audition:1 lock:1 undo:1 redo:0 save:1 saveas:1 open:1 userig:1 saverig:1 empty:1 example:1 fullscreen:1 textsize:1 keysheet:1 BIND bind or unbind selected
DO newvalue ""
EXPECT 0 1 "a value needs a name"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1
DO newvalue "reverb"
EXPECT 1 0 "value reverb, 0 to 1"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1 | U 0 reverb:0:1:0 | X0
