# ; and ' step the selected nodes' current value by a twentieth of its range (a hundredth with shift), landing on the next multiple, held inside the range
EDIT values_stepped ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
DO example
EXPECT 1 0 ""
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1
DO newvalue "distance 0 10"
EXPECT 1 0 "value distance, 0 to 10"
STATE N O@0.3,0.5 N@0.3,0.8 E@0.5,0.5 S@0.3,0.2 W@0.1,0.5 A@0.65,0.35 B@0.9,0.35 C@0.9,0.65 D@0.65,0.65 | R O,N,E O,E,S O,S,W O,W,N A,B,C,D | O front:0:1 left:1:1 right:2:1 rear:3:1 | L O>front:1 O>left:1 O>right:1 O>rear:1 N>front:1 E>right:1 S>rear:1 W>left:1 B>right:1 B>~:1 C>left:1 C>right:1 D>rear:1 D>~:0.333333 | D sub:4:N,O | C front | S front | A 1 | U 0 distance:0:10:0 | X0
