# what each key does to the typing line: printable keys add, up to 40; backspace and delete take the last away; return ends it to be made, escape unmade; other keys are ignored
EDIT values_typing ANALYTIC
GRID FREE
TYPE "" 114 101 118 101 114 98 13 EXPECT "reverb" enter
TYPE "" 100 105 115 116 120 8 32 48 32 49 48 13 EXPECT "dist 0 10" enter
TYPE "far 0 4" 127 127 57 EXPECT "far 09" open
TYPE "" 97 27 98 EXPECT "a" escape
TYPE "" 357 9 113 EXPECT "q" open
TYPE "" 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 120 EXPECT "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx" open
ENDEDIT

#--------------------------------------------------------------------
# ROUND 3A-8: A RING OR A BLOCK IN ONE STEP
#--------------------------------------------------------------------
# l on the polar grid: a ring on the ring nearest the point, one node per spoke, numbered clockwise from the spoke nearest the front, joined as one region, each with its own outputs -- on every level. Refused at the centre, off the map, or on a node
EDIT layout_ring ANALYTIC
GRID POLAR 0.5 0.5 0.1 8 0
KEYS drag=0 aud=0 grid=polar EXPECT place:1 box:0 toggle:0 all:0 none:0 move:0 freehand:0 join:0 unjoin:0 remove:0 gridkind:1 rotate:1 spacing:1 spokes:1 deadzone:1 layoutsize:1 layout:1 newoutput:1 pickoutput:0 addoutput:0 nextoutput:0 bind:0 bindall:0 fill:0 clear:0 silence:0 derivedafter:0 derived:0 trim:0 removeoutput:0 autooutput:1 levelswitch:0 newlevel:1 raise:0 movelevel:0 match:0 removelevel:0 view3d:1 newvalue:1 pickvalue:0 stepvalue:0 editvalue:0 removevalue:0 audition:1 lock:1 undo:0 redo:0 save:1 saveas:1 open:1 userig:1 saverig:0 empty:1 example:1 fullscreen:1 textsize:1 keysheet:1 BIND bind or unbind selected
DO newlevel 1
EXPECT 1 0 "new level 2 of 2, at 0.25, with 0 outputs of its own"
STATE N  | R  | O  | L  | D  | C - | S - | A 1 | V 1 | Z0 0 K | Z1 0.25 K
DO layout 0.52 0.79 1 0
EXPECT 1 0 "ring of 8 nodes"
STATE N n0@0.5,0.8 n1@0.712132,0.712132 n2@0.8,0.5 n3@0.712132,0.287868 n4@0.5,0.2 n5@0.287868,0.287868 n6@0.2,0.5 n7@0.287868,0.712132 | R n0,n1,n2,n3,n4,n5,n6,n7 | O n0:0:1 n1:1:1 n2:2:1 n3:3:1 n4:4:1 n5:5:1 n6:6:1 n7:7:1 n0-2:8:1 n1-2:9:1 n2-2:10:1 n3-2:11:1 n4-2:12:1 n5-2:13:1 n6-2:14:1 n7-2:15:1 | L n0>n0-2:1 n1>n1-2:1 n2>n2-2:1 n3>n3-2:1 n4>n4-2:1 n5>n5-2:1 n6>n6-2:1 n7>n7-2:1 | D  | C n0 | S n0 | A 1 | V 1 | Z0 0 K n0>n0:1 n1>n1:1 n2>n2:1 n3>n3:1 n4>n4:1 n5>n5:1 n6>n6:1 n7>n7:1 | Z1 0.25 K n0>n0-2:1 n1>n1-2:1 n2>n2-2:1 n3>n3-2:1 n4>n4-2:1 n5>n5-2:1 n6>n6-2:1 n7>n7-2:1
